@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@
+/*
+ * Combined libffi closure allocator for Emscripten/WebAssembly.
+ *
+ * LWJGL's upcall machinery (org.lwjgl.system.Upcalls) allocates a libffi
+ * closure with the split ffi_closure_alloc() + ffi_prep_closure_loc() pair.
+ * On wasm those two are no-op stubs: ffi_closure_alloc() returns NULL and
+ * ffi_prep_closure_loc() returns FFI_BAD_TYPEDEF, because wasm closures are
+ * claimed from a pool of pre-emitted signature trampolines and therefore need
+ * the cif (signature) known at allocation time.
+ *
+ * The patched libffi provides the combined ffi_alloc_prep_closure() for exactly
+ * this case. This file exposes it as a single native for the patched Upcalls
+ * class: it allocates + prepares in one call, writes the executable trampoline
